      "Josef Holzer, Class of 2013"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Josef Holzer helped build and sustain Cleveland's Donauschwaben community after arriving in the United States from Europe. Through decades of organizational leadership, mentoring, cultural preservation, and service, he supported German heritage institutions, youth activities, and community events that kept language, music, dance, and memory visible in Greater Cleveland."
    ]
